    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Recently, three brothers set a world record by rowing across the Pacific Ocean. Altogether, they travelled more than 14,000 kilometres. People "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cheered",
            "ref": "v-cheer"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " excitedly when they finally reached land. The brothers are now the first team ever to finish this journey."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The trip was very difficult. Strong storms "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hit",
            "ref": "v-hit"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their small boat. At one point, one of the brothers fell off the boat. But he climbed back safely. Food once "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ran low",
            "ref": "v-run-low"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They had to row harder to reach land to get food. Despite all these difficulties, they finished the trip in just 139 days. More than 50 family members and friends were waiting to welcome them back. The brothers waved flags happily as they arrived. People hugged them and cheered."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The brothers broke the old record of 160 days. It was set by a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Russian rower",
            "zh": "俄罗斯划船手"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in 2014."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But for the brothers, the journey wasn’t just about records. They also "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "raised",
            "ref": "v-raise"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " more than $1.6 million. They planned to use the money to bring clean water to 40,000 people."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“This journey is the hardest thing we’ve ever done,” said the brothers right after arriving. “We feel happy but really tired.” They added that the journey also taught them to enjoy simple things in life—like taking a shower or sleeping in a bed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
